# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""TkvUI.Viet - Vietnamese bitmap text support (pure 100% TokenVector)

Bang pattern 5x7 cho 134 ky tu Viet precomposed (sinh bang script ngoai repo tu
base ASCII + overlay dau, da QA art + kiem va cham pairwise): moi glyph la
mot int 35-bit (7 hang x 5 bit), -1 = la.
Chuoi tkv index theo byte UTF-8 nen ky tu Viet dai 2-3 don vi; so sanh bang
byte-day-du van dung (da probe): ghep don vi roi so == literal.

Phu thuoc: Core. Khong vong import (Text/Widgets/Media import Viet).
"""

__tkv_import__ = ["TkvUI.Core"]

